.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		Quantum ESPRESSO, PBE, plane waves, 2x2x2 cells of the cubic cell. This calculation shows the simple cubic packing of alpha polonium: one atom in the cubic cell, six nearest neighbours, and 52 % of the space filled by the atoms.
